items.fromString:
When navigating the Red Hat Insights app within Splunk it's not possible to change the dates components report by default. Specifically interested in being able to expand the date range reported by the dashboard for Vulnerability and Compliance.

For example when opening the Insights dashboard in Splunk it may be good to see a broader range for vulnerability than 24 hours. This is what we would like to address with this RFE. Example screenshot;

!image-2024-08-11-21-36-28-363.png!

